Sol. (c)
Given, \( x+\frac{1}{x}=a \)
Now, \( x^{3}+x^{2}+\frac{1}{x^{3}}+\frac{1}{x^{2}}=\left(x^{3}+\frac{1}{x^{3}}\right)+\left(x^{2}+\frac{1}{x^{2}}\right) \)
