U7: what is control what is control variable what is control variable means in short form it can be be the same so I am correct so I want to understand in my chapter I can't understand what is this control I understood but what is independent variable and depended variable I can't understand this at all the chapter name is sound the chapter name is sound","**Control / control variable (short):** **things kept the same** in an experiment (yes, that means “same,” so you are correct).

**Independent variable:** the **one thing you change** on purpose. 
**Dependent variable:** the **thing that changes because of it** (the result you observe/measure).

In **Sound**, a simple example is: “If I hit a drum harder, what happens?”
- Independent variable: **how hard you hit** (soft vs hard)
- Dependent variable: **loudness of sound** (soft vs loud)
- Control variables: **same drum, same place, same person, same distance from the drum**

