U7: ith engane kidiyath Malayalathil parayu","ശരി, നോക്കാം.

ഉള്ളത്: 
\[
\frac{1}{8} + \frac{1}{5} + \frac{1}{2}
\]

മൂന്നും കൂടാൻ, ആദ്യം **ഒരു പോലെ ആയ ഹരം (common denominator)** എടുക്കണം. 
8, 5, 2 ഇവയുടെ **LCM = 40**.

അപ്പോൾ ഓരോ ഭിന്നവും 40 ആണെന്നുള്ള ഹരത്തിലേക്ക് മാറ്റാം:

- \(\frac{1}{8} = \frac{5}{40}\) (8 × 5 = 40)
- \(\frac{1}{5} = \frac{8}{40}\) (5 × 8 = 40)
- \(\frac{1}{2} = \frac{20}{40}\) (2 × 20 = 40)

ഇപ്പൊ കൂട്ടാം:

\[
\frac{5}{40} + \frac{8}{40} + \frac{20}{40} 
= \frac{5 + 8 + 20}{40} 
= \frac{33}{40}
\]

അതിനാൽ ഉത്തരം: 
**\(\dfrac{33}{40}\)** ആണ്.",Procedural,5,5,5,10,Academic,,,1.0000,13109,217,0.003231,The bot correctly identified the incomplete user inputs and requested clarification appropriately before providing a complete and accurate solution. The final user request for translation was also fulfilled correctly. There are no failures or issues in the conversation.,0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,same_intent_reask | gate_llm,gate_llm
