## **(a) \(\dfrac{3}{10} + 3\dfrac{4}{100}\)**

**Step 1: भिन्नों को दशमलव में बदलो**
- \(\dfrac{3}{10}=0.3=0.30\)
- \(3\dfrac{4}{100}=3+\dfrac{4}{100}=3+0.04=3.04\)

**Step 2: जोड़ो (दशमलव बिंदु एक लाइन में)**
\[
\begin{array}{r}
3.04\\
+0.30\\
\hline
3.34
\end{array}
\]

**उत्तर: \(\mathbf{3.34}\)**

---

## **(c) \(15\dfrac{6}{10}\dfrac{4}{100}+14\dfrac{3}{10}\dfrac{6}{100}\)** 
(यहाँ “\(15\dfrac{6}{10}\dfrac{4}{100}\)” का मतलब है \(15+\dfrac{6}{10}+\dfrac{4}{100}\))

### पहला संख्या: \(15+\dfrac{6}{10}+\dfrac{4}{100}\)
- \(\dfrac{6}{10}=0.6\)
- \(\dfrac{4}{100}=0.04\)

तो:
\[
15+0.6+0.04=15.64
\]

### दूसरा संख्या: \(14+\dfrac{3}{10}+\dfrac{6}{100}\)
- \(\dfrac{3}{10}=0.3\)
- \(\dfrac{6}{100}=0.06\)

तो:
\[
14+0.3+0.06=14.36
\]

**अब जोड़ो**
\[
\begin{array}{r}
15.64\\
+14.36\\
\hline
30.00
\end{array}
\]

**उत्तर: \(\mathbf{30}\)**

---

## **(e) \(8\dfrac{6}{10}-5\dfrac{3}{100}\)**

**Step 1: दशमलव में बदलो**
- \(8\dfrac{6}{10}=8+\dfrac{6}{10}=8+0.6=8.6=8.60\)
- \(5\dfrac{3}{100}=5+\dfrac{3}{100}=5+0.03=5.03\)

**Step 2: घटाओ (दशमलव बिंदु एक लाइन में)**
\[
\begin{array}{r}
8.60\\
-5.03\\
\hline
3.57
\end{array}
\]

**उत्तर: \(\mathbf{3.57}\)**

