U6: Steps by Steps batao na muhje kush nahi samhje hai","**ठीक है — मैं step-by-step दिखा रहा/रही हूँ। (मैं calculation में extra digits रखूँगा/रखूँगी, round अंत में करेंगे.)**

हमें \((a+ib)^{x+iy}\) को \(A+iB\) के रूप में लिखना है।

---

\[
(a+ib)^{x+iy}=e^{(x+iy)\Log(a+ib)}
\]

अब \(a+ib\) को polar form में लिखते हैं:

\[
r=\sqrt{a^{2}+b^{2}},\qquad \theta=\Arg(a+ib)=\tan^{-1}\!\left(\frac{b}{a}\right)\;(\text{सही quadrant ध्यान में रखें})
\]

इसलिए
\[
a+ib=re^{i\theta}
\]

अब Complex log (principal value) :
\[
\Log(a+ib)=\Log(re^{i\theta})=\ln r+i\theta
\]

और
\[
\ln r=\ln\left(\sqrt{a^{2}+b^{2}}\right)=\frac12\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})
\]

तो
\[
\Log(a+ib)=\frac12\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})+i\theta
\]

---

अब इसे \((x+iy)\) से multiply करो:

\[
(x+iy)\left(\frac12\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})+i\theta\right)
\]

FOIL (चार terms):

1) \(x\cdot \frac12\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})=\frac{x}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})\)

2) \(x\cdot i\theta=i x\theta\)

3) \(iy\cdot \frac12\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})=i\frac{y}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})\)

4) \(iy\cdot i\theta=i^{2}y\theta=-y\theta\)

सब जोड़कर:

\[
(x+iy)\Log(a+ib)=\left(\frac{x}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})-y\theta\right)
+i\left(x\theta+\frac{y}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})\right)
\]

मान लो
\[
u=\frac{x}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})-y\theta,\qquad 
v=x\theta+\frac{y}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})
\]

तो
\[
(a+ib)^{x+iy}=e^{u+iv}=e^{u}(\cos v+i\sin v)
\]

---

अब सीधा \(A+iB\) मिल गया:

\[
\boxed{A=e^{u}\cos v}
\qquad
\boxed{B=e^{u}\sin v}
\]

जहाँ
\[
\boxed{u=\frac{x}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})-y\theta}
\]
\[
\boxed{v=x\theta+\frac{y}{2}\ln(a^{2}+b^{2})}
\]
और \(\theta=\Arg(a+ib)=\tan^{-1}\!\left(\frac{b}{a}\right)\) (quadrant के हिसाब से).

---

अगर तुम \(a\) और \(b\) का sign बता दो (जैसे \(a>0\) या \(a<0\)), तो मैं \(\theta\) का exact principal value भी सही-case के साथ लिख दूँ।",Conceptual,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Image Upload,,,0.9500,16161,250,0.003893,"The bot consistently provides correct, detailed, and step-by-step explanations addressing the user's queries about reducing complex expressions to the form A+iB. There are no detected failures or misalignments in the conversation. The user shows some confusion but does not explicitly reject or complain about the bot's responses.",0,full_rate,Academic,Concept Explanation,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
