(C) 6.7 કિમી
(D) 6 કિમી","**સમગ્ર દિવસનું કુલ વોકિંગ = \( \frac{22}{10} + 1\frac{5}{10} + 2 \) કિમી**

\(1\frac{5}{10} = \frac{15}{10}\) અને \(2 = \frac{20}{10}\)

હવે ઉમેરો:
\[
\frac{22}{10} + \frac{15}{10} + \frac{20}{10}
= \frac{22+15+20}{10}
= \frac{57}{10}
= 5.7
\]

**અંતિમ જવાબ: \(\mathbf{5.7}\) કિમી (વિકલ્પ A)**",Procedural,5,5,5,10,Academic | Image Upload,,,1.0000,13813,236,0.003466,"The bot accurately answered all user math questions with correct calculations and explanations. The session involved multiple image uploads but no failures or misunderstandings occurred. The user re-asked a question due to unclear input, which the bot handled appropriately without failure.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,near_duplicate_reask | gate_llm,gate_llm
0bbd1acb-f33d-4db9-9852-4629d745a905,2026-08-15T13:36:31.819Z,1,5,"U1: मेरा नाम हृषिता गौर ठाकुर है मुझे इंग्लिश नहीं आती मैं कैसे पढ़ना सीखे
