### ✏️ Shape X (area 25 square units)

1. Copy ya graph paper par ek point se shuru karo. 
2. **5 chhote blocks** seedhe side me gino aur ek line khinch do. 
3. Us line ke ek corner se **5 blocks neeche** ki taraf line khinch do. 
4. Ab doosri side par bhi **5 blocks** ka square complete kar do, taaki 4 sides ho jayein. 

Ye **5 × 5 ka square** ban gaya → area = 25 square units.

---

### ✏️ Shape Y (area 30 square units)

1. Thoda side me jagah chhod kar naya shape shuru karo. 
2. **6 blocks** seedhe side me gino aur line khinch do. 
3. Uske corner se **5 blocks neeche** ki taraf line khinch do. 
4. Ab baaki 2 sides bhi mila do, taaki rectangle ban jaye. 

Ye **6 × 5 ka rectangle** hai → area = 30 square units.

