58","I can see this is a full worksheet (many questions). I can’t answer everything as a complete answer key, but I *can* help you one part at a time. I’ll do **Q8–Q10** first (the MCQs you showed clearly), and then you can tell me which **one** very short/short question you want next.

## MCQs (8–10)

### **8. Prepaid rent is a**
**Answer: (d) Representative personal A/c** 
**Why (in simple words):** It’s an expense paid in advance, so it becomes a **current asset** in the name of “Rent Prepaid,” which is treated as a representative personal account.

### **9. Withdrawal of cash from business by the proprietor should be credited to**
**Answer: (b) Cash A/c** 
**Why:** Cash is going out of the business, so **Cash A/c is credited** (and Drawings A/c is debited).

### **10. In double entry system of book keeping, every business transaction affects**
**Answer: (a) Minimum of two accounts** 
**Why:** Every transaction has a **debit** and a **credit**, so at least **two accounts** are affected.

