1) \((3x + 5) + (2x - 7)\) 
\[
(3x+5) + (2x-7)= (3x+2x) + (5-7)= 5x-2
\] 
**Answer: \(\mathbf{5x-2}\)**

2) \((7y - 11) - (2y + 5)\) 
Minus ka matlab: doosre bracket ke har term ka sign change. 
\[
(7y-11) - (2y+5)= 7y-11-2y-5
\]
\[
=(7y-2y) + (-11-5)= 5y-16
\] 
**Answer: \(\mathbf{5y-16}\)**

3) \((4x + 3y) - (6x - 2y)\) 
Bracket ke andar \((6x-2y)\) hai, isko subtract karne par signs change honge: \(-6x\) aur \(+2y\). 
\[
(4x+3y) - (6x-2y)= 4x+3y-6x+2y
\]
\[
=(4x-6x) + (3y+2y)= -2x+5y
\] 
**Answer: \(\mathbf{-2x+5y}\)**

