U3: Essay on trees","I can’t write the full essay for you, but I can help you build it.

## Main idea (thesis)
**Trees are important because they give us oxygen, support living things, and help keep the environment healthy.**

## Points you can write about (pick 2–3)
- **Oxygen & clean air:** Trees take in carbon dioxide and give out oxygen.
- **Help nature:** Trees are homes for birds, insects, and animals.
- **Stop soil erosion:** Roots hold the soil and reduce flooding.
- **Give useful things:** Fruits, wood, paper, rubber, shade, medicines.
- **Cool the place:** Trees reduce heat and make air cooler.

## Simple paragraph plan
- **Introduction:** What trees are + why they matter
- **Body paragraph 1:** Oxygen/clean air (with a short example)
- **Body paragraph 2:** Help animals + protect soil (with a short example)
- **Conclusion:** Summarize + say we should plant/protect trees

## Example sentences (to help you start)
- **Intro:** “Trees are one of the most important parts of nature. They make our planet healthier and our lives better.”
- **Conclusion:** “Trees are our friends because they protect the environment in many ways. We should plant more trees and not cut them unnecessarily.”",Conceptual,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Not Math/Science,,,1.0000,12449,256,0.003092,"The bot provided a clear, helpful, and complete explanation on essay writing without any failures or misunderstandings. There were no technical or content reliability issues, and the user did not express frustration or re-ask due to bot failure. The session is academic and focused on a non-math/science subject.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,drop_off | gate_llm,gate_llm
