U3: I am cbsc","Got it, CBSE helps a lot. Now I just need **one more thing** to really help you:

➡️ **Please type the names of your 4 chapters** (for this 30-mark exam).

---

### For today (so you don’t lose another day)

Do this **even before you send chapters**:

**1. Take your syllabus paper / textbook index** 
